# Fixed parity case: explicit pending target replay plus Regis turn-end growth.
# 1) P0 plays 夜行吸血鬼.
# 2) P1 plays 吸血鬼女 and the C++ kernel pauses for choose_target.
# 3) P1 chooses P0's 夜行吸血鬼.
# 雷吉斯：重生 now grows in hand/deck on owner turn_end when an enemy unit has bleeding; this should match Python.
play_hand p=0 h=0 row=melee side=self
play_hand p=1 h=0 row=melee side=self
choose_target p=1 target=enemy:melee:1
